# Ignore everything by default — this repo tracks council.html + test.html,
# the data/style files they actually load via <script src>/<link>, and (as of
# 2026-09-01) the documented Python build/analysis tooling behind the data
# pipeline (regen3.py etc., see the allowlist section below), so the repo's
# language stats actually reflect that work instead of showing ~100% HTML.
# Everything else (raw votedata/, one-off backup/scratch files, undocumented
# parsing/repair scripts) stays local and untracked.
*

